{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1398561","title":"nformation on the microbial community of actual coal-to-hydrogen wastewater treated by partial denitrification -anammox process(PD/A)","description":"The microbial community data is categorized into three systems: the PD/A system, PD/A-FeS system, and PD/A-FeS@ZVI system. Specifically, A_1 and A_2 represent the microbial community information of the PD/A system before and after the toxic shock, respectively. B_1, B_2, B_3, and B_4 correspond to the microbial community data of the PD/A-FeS system before the shock, immediately after the shock, and during the stabilization phase. B_5 and B_6 represent the microbial community data of the PD/A-FeS@ZVI system. These microbial community profiles reflect the microbial succession in the PD/A process during the treatment of actual coal-to-hydrogen wastewater.","center":"Hefei University of Technology","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/01/06 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN54453831","MIMARKS Specimen sample from metagenomes","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-07-10",2023,"CN","Anhui",1808722,"Hefei","verified",31.5,117.17,"China: Hefei",null,"biome [ENVO:00000428]","wastewater treatment plant [ENVO:00000340]","anaerobic environment [ENVO:00002032]","named urban infrastructure at sample level"],["SAMN54453832","MIMARKS Specimen sample from metagenomes","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-10-20",2023,"CN","Anhui",1808722,"Hefei","verified",31.5,117.17,"China: Hefei",null,"biome [ENVO:00000428]","wastewater treatment plant [ENVO:00000340]","anaerobic environment [ENVO:00002032]","named urban infrastructure at sample level"],["SAMN54453833","MIMARKS Specimen sample from metagenomes","confi